OL,3,A'Ironing board' seats to be replaced on
OL,4,AThameslink
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Ironing board" seats on some commuter
OL,7,Ftrains will get extra cushioning, the
OL,8,Ftransport secretary has said, more than
OL,9,Fa decade after the government spent
OL,10,F#1.6bn of public money building the
OL,11,Ffleet.
OL,13,FHeidi Alexander announced that more
OL,14,Fthan 60,000 seats on all 115 Thameslink
OL,15,Ftrains would get new cushions and
OL,16,Fbackrests, replacing much-criticised
OL,17,Fthin and hard seats.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,114,105,200,300,0,100
